content:
Pmt:2370
A high-contrast vector art portrait in the style of a modern graphic novel. The subject is rendered with sharp, clean lines and detailed cell shading. The color palette is dominated by deep navy blue and teal skin tones, contrasted sharply by intense, glowing neon red rim lighting that outlines the silhouette and highlights the facial features.background is a smooth vertical gradient transitioning from deep midnight blue at the top to a vibrant, fiery red at the bottom.
@iam_zundarzxo

